===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ancient Origins|Relicanth|23}} from the {{TCG|Ancient Origins}} expansion; both cards have the Take Down attack.
*{{m|Take Down}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that Relicanth can learn.
